{"seq":3,"slug":"holiday-retro-crossyear-plan","title":"节日复盘（销售/履约/ROI）与跨年规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/post-holiday-peak/holiday-retro-crossyear-plan","wordCount":2365,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"节日复盘-销售-履约-roi-与跨年规划\">节日复盘（销售/履约/ROI）与跨年规划</h1><p>一场节日运营结束后，团队通常会收到三份互不对话的报告：销售团队说 GMV 增长了多少，供应链团队说缺货率是多少，财务说这次大促的 ROI 是多少。三份报告都正确，但把它们放在一起时你会发现它们无法相互解释——因为它们用的是不同的时间窗、不同的订单口径、不同的成本归集方式。复盘失效的原因很少是数据不够，而是<strong>口径不统一</strong>。</p>\n<p>本篇是整个 hub 的闭环出口。它处理三件事：销售、履约、ROI 三条线的指标如何对齐到同一张日历上；归因怎么做才不会把错误的原因写进下一年的计划；以及最终产出——下一年的备货提前量修正值应该怎么算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>口径不统一体现在四个具体维度上，每一个都会导致结论分叉。</p>\n<p><strong>时间窗</strong>。销售按自然月统计，履约按大促活动期统计，财务按结算周期统计。一个跨月的节日（如斋月横跨两个月）在三份报告里会被切成不同份额。解决办法是引入<strong>日历对齐的活动窗口</strong>——用第 1 章的日历条目为锚，为每个节日定义一个 <code>festival_window</code>（含预热、高潮、返场三段），所有指标都按这个窗口裁剪。</p>\n<p><strong>订单口径</strong>。销售用「下单口径」（placed），履约用「发货口径」（shipped），财务用「确认收货口径」（received）。节日的跨期效应会让这三个数字相差可观：节前下的单节后才发。必须显式声明每份报告用的是哪一个口径，并在需要时给出三者的转换率。</p>\n<p><strong>成本归集</strong>。销售报告的「毛利」通常只扣商品成本，而节日运营的真实成本还包括促销折扣、广告投放、旺季运价溢价、加班人力、以及节后清仓损失。ROI 的计算必须把它们全部纳入，否则节日的 ROI 会被系统性高估。</p>\n<p><strong>库存价值口径</strong>。节后剩余库存按成本计价还是按可变现净值计价，会直接影响损益。第 4 章第 2 篇给出的清仓判定正是为此服务——它提供了「可变现净值」的估算方法（见 <a href=\"seasonal-clearance-markdown\">节后清仓降价与季节库存出清</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>常见分叉</th>\n<th>对齐方式</th>\n<th>未对齐的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间窗</td>\n<td>自然月 vs 活动期 vs 结算期</td>\n<td>用日历锚定 <code>festival_window</code></td>\n<td>节日贡献被切碎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单口径</td>\n<td>下单 / 发货 / 确认收货</td>\n<td>显式声明 + 转换率</td>\n<td>销售额与履约量对不上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本归集</td>\n<td>只算商品成本</td>\n<td>纳入折扣/广告/溢价/人力/清仓</td>\n<td>ROI 系统性高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存计价</td>\n<td>成本 vs 可变现净值</td>\n<td>用清仓判定给出的净值</td>\n<td>损益被推迟暴露</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"统一口径的报告结构\">统一口径的报告结构</h3><p>把三条线合并成一张事实表是最有效的落地方式。它的键是「日历版本 × 节日 × 市场 × SKU」，度量包含销售、履约、成本三类。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE festival_period_fact (&#10;  calendar_version  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  festival_code     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  market            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  window_phase      TEXT NOT NULL        -- tease | burst | extend | post&#10;                    CHECK (window_phase IN (&#39;tease&#39;,&#39;burst&#39;,&#39;extend&#39;,&#39;post&#39;)),&#10;  -- 销售&#10;  units_placed      INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  units_shipped     INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  units_received    INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  gross_revenue     NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  -- 履约&#10;  stockout_units    INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  on_time_ship_rate NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  promise_miss_rate NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  -- 成本&#10;  cogs              NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  promo_discount    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  ad_spend          NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  freight_premium   NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  labor_overtime    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  clearance_loss    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (calendar_version, festival_code, market, sku_id, window_phase)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> festival_period_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calendar_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  festival_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_phase      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        -- tease | burst | extend | post</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window_phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tease'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'burst'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'extend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 销售</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  units_placed      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  units_shipped     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  units_received    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_revenue     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 履约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stockout_units    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  on_time_ship_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promise_miss_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 成本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cogs              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promo_discount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ad_spend          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  freight_premium   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  labor_overtime    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clearance_loss    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (calendar_version, festival_code, market, sku_id, window_phase)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>calendar_version</code> 放进主键是刻意的：它让「按当年生效的日历复盘」成为默认行为，也使得历史复盘在日历被修正后依然可复现。这一纪律从第 1 章贯穿到这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roi-与归因\">ROI 与归因</h2><h3 id=\"节日-roi-的正确算式\">节日 ROI 的正确算式</h3><p>节日的净收益不是毛利，而是扣掉节日特有成本后的净额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{G - C_{cogs} - C_{p