n><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{residual}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节后剩余库存的可变现净值（不是零，也不是原始成本）。这个式子里最容易被漏掉的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{clear}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（清仓损失）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{residual}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它们是一枚硬币的两面——如果节后库存以低于成本的价格清掉，损失应计入本期节日；如果能以较好价格持有到明年，则应把这部分价值加回。</p>\n<p>一项可以直接引用的规模参照：美国零售联合会的口径下，2024 年 11–12 月的假日零售额同比增长 4% 至创纪录的 9941 亿美元，而 NRF 对 2025 年全年零售额（非假日口径）的预测区间为 5.42 万亿至 5.48 万亿美元、增速 2.7%–3.7%（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Retail_Federation\">NRF 词条</a>）。这两组数字的用途不同：前者用来判断自己假日增速相对行业的位置，后者用来校准全年基线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因的三个陷阱\">归因的三个陷阱</h3><p><strong>把相关当因果</strong>。某市场今年黑五 GMV 增长，同期该市场整体大盘也在增长，那么「我们的营销做得好」这个结论就不成立。归因必须扣除市场基线与季节性基线。</p>\n<p><strong>把缺货当需求不足</strong>。缺货造成的销量损失不会出现在销售数据里，它会伪装成「这个 SKU 卖得不好」。因此复盘必须把 <code>stockout_units</code> 作为独立度量——缺货损失的销量应该按「有货时的转化率」反推估算，并计入「本可以卖多少」。</p>\n<p><strong>把清仓当常态成本</strong>。清仓损失如果每年都发生且金额稳定，它不是意外，而是<strong>备货量的系统性偏差</strong>，应该被识别出来并写进下一年的定量参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[节日期结束] --&gt; B[按 calendar_version 汇总事实表]&#10;  B --&gt; C[销售线:GMV/毛利率/动销]&#10;  B --&gt; D[履约线:准时率/缺货率/承诺违约率]&#10;  B --&gt; E[成本线:折扣/广告/运价/人力/清仓]&#10;  C --&gt; F[扣市场与季节基线]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[识别偏差来源]&#10;  G --&gt; H{偏差是否为系统性}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[修正下一年参数&lt;br/&gt;提前量/定量/容量]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[记录为一次性事件]&#10;  I --&gt; K[写入次年日历规划基线]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[节日期结束] --&gt; B[按 calendar_version 汇总事实表]\n  B --&gt; C[销售线:GMV/毛利率/动销]\n  B --&gt; D[履约线:准时率/缺货率/承诺违约率]\n  B --&gt; E[成本线:折扣/广告/运价/人力/清仓]\n  C --&gt; F[扣市场与季节基线]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[识别偏差来源]\n  G --&gt; H{偏差是否为系统性}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[修正下一年参数&lt;br/&gt;提前量/定量/容量]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[记录为一次性事件]\n  I --&gt; K[写入次年日历规划基线]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h3 id=\"事件级数据的价值\">事件级数据的价值</h3><p>口径统一解决的是聚合层面的可比性，但归因的深度取决于<strong>事件级数据的粒度</strong>。要把「这批货为什么晚了三天」追到具体环节，需要的是每一件货在每个节点的事件记录，而不是一个汇总的平均时效。零售与物流领域用于这件事的标准模型是 GS1 的 EPCIS——<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EPCIS\">EPCIS 词条</a>记载它于 <strong>2007 年 4 月首次获批为 1.0 版</strong>，1.1 与 1.2 分别在 2014 年 5 月与 2016 年 9 月获批，<strong>2.0 版与配套的 CBV 2.0 于 2022 年 6 月获批</strong>，2.1 版计划在 2026 年底发布。</p>\n<p>这件事对复盘的现实意义是：如果你的履约事件已经按 EPCIS 的对象事件/聚合事件/转换事件组织，那么复盘时可以从「平均准时率」下钻到「某个订单在哪一段损失了几天」，而不需要另建一套日志。反过来说，如果在节日期间没有留下事件级记录，节后复盘就只能停留在汇总结论上，无法定位到具体环节——这正是「复盘要提前设计数据」这一原则的由来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨年规划-把今年的偏差变成明年的参数\">跨年规划：把今年的偏差变成明年的参数</h2><p>复盘的产出物不应该是一份报告，而应该是<strong>一组写回日历规划基线的参数修正值</strong>。报告会被归档，参数会改变明年的行为。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差类型</th>\n<th>观测信号</th>\n<th>修正的参数</th>\n<th>修正方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>备货量系统性偏少</td>\n<td>连续缺货率高</td>\n<td>首单量的服务水平目标</td>\n<td>调高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备货量系统性偏多</td>\n<td>清仓损失稳定出现</td>\n<td>首单量的服务水平目标</td>\n<td>调低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前期估计偏乐观</td>\n<td>承诺违约率高且集中在清关段</td>\n<td>截单日的清关分段分位数</td>\n<td>调高（用更保守的分位）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量估计不足</td>\n<td>峰值等待时间超标</td>\n<td>容量预案的利用率上限</td>\n<td>调低（留更多余量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节奏错配</td>\n<td>预热期转化低、高潮期缺货</td>\n<td>节奏三段的日期与预算权重</td>\n<td>前移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类判断失误</td>\n<td>某品类动销远低于权重预期</td>\n<td>节令品类权重表</td>\n<td>按实际重估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的每一行都对应本 hub 前几章的一个参数：首单定量来自第 2 章第 1 篇的报童结构，截单日分段来自第 3 章第 1 篇的时效表，容量利用率上限来自第 2 章第 3 篇的排队模型，节奏权重来自第 3 章第 2 篇的节奏数据。这就是「闭环」的具体含义：<strong>复盘的输出恰好是各章输入参数的更新</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;planning_cycle&quot;: &quot;2027&quot;,&#10;  &quot;derived_from&quot;: { &quot;calendar_version&quot;: &quot;2026.0&quot;, &quot;reviewed_at&quot;: &quot;2027-01-15T00:00:00Z&quot; },&#10;  &quot;parameter_updates&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;param&quot;: &quot;npi.first_order_csl_target&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;US/christmas/toys&quot;,&#10;      &quot;old&quot;: 0.78,&#10;      &quot;new&quot;: 0.84,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;连续两年缺货，清仓损失低于缺货损失&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;param&quot;: &quot;cutoff.import_clear_quantile&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;CN-&gt;US/ocean&quot;,&#10;      &quot;old&quot;: &quot;p90&quot;,&#10;      &quot;new&quot;: &quot;p92&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;承诺违约集中在清关段&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;param&quot;: &quot;capacity.target_utilization&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;US/black_friday/pack&quot;,&#10;      &quot;old&quot;: 0.85,&#10;      &quot;new&quot;: 0.8,&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;峰值等待时间超出目标&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;one_off_events&quot;: [{ &quot;event&quot;: &quot;2026-11 港口拥堵&quot;, &quot;impact_days&quot;: 4, &quot;exclude_from_baseline&quot;: true }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"planning_cycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"derived_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reviewed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-01-15T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parameter_updates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npi.first_order_csl_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US/christmas/toys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"old\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.84</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"连续两年缺货，清仓损失低于缺货损失\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cutoff.import_clear_quantile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN->US/ocean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"old\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p92\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"承诺违约集中在清关段\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"param\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"capacity.target_utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US/black_friday/pack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"old\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"峰值等待时间超出目标\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"one_off_events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11 港口拥堵\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"impact_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"exclude_from_baseline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>one_off_events</code> 这一栏是必需的，它与 <code>parameter_updates</code> 相对：<strong>一次性事件不应该被写进基线参数</strong>，否则明年的参数会被一次偶发事件污染。把偶发与系统偏差分开，是跨年规划里最容易做错、也最影响长期准确性的一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复盘失效通常源于口径不统一：时间窗、订单口径、成本归集、库存计价四个维度必须显式对齐。</li>\n<li>用日历锚定的 <code>festival_window</code> 统一时间窗，把 <code>calendar_version</code> 放进事实表主键使历史复盘可复现。</li>\n<li>节日 ROI 必须纳入折扣、广告、旺季运价溢价、加班人力与清仓损失，并把节后库存的可变现净值加回。</li>\n<li>归因要避开三个陷阱：把相关当因果、把缺货当需求不足、把清仓当常态成本。</li>\n<li>事件级数据（如按 EPCIS 组织的事件）决定归因深度；EPCIS 2.0 与 CBV 2.0 于 2022 年 6 月获批，2.1 计划 2026 年底发布。</li>\n<li>复盘的产出应是写回下一年各章输入参数的修正值，并把一次性事件排除在基线之外。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"节日复盘（销售/履约/ROI）与跨年规划","id":"节日复盘-销售-履约-roi-与跨年规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"统一口径的报告结构","id":"统一口径的报告结构"},{"level":2,"text":"ROI 与归因","id":"roi-与归因"},{"level":3,"text":"节日 ROI 的正确算式","id":"节日-roi-的正确算式"},{"level":3,"text":"归因的三个陷阱","id":"归因的三个陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"事件级数据的价值","id":"事件级数据的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"跨年规划：把今年的偏差变成明年的参数","id":"跨年规划-把今年的偏差变成明年的参数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"节后清仓降价与季节库存出清","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/post-holiday-peak/seasonal-clearance-markdown"},"next":null}